{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39890","headline":"溪隐 · 徐夤","name":"溪隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将名将利已无缘，深隐清溪拟学仙。\n绝却腥羶胜服药，断除桮酒合延年。\n蜗牛壳漏宁同舍，榆荚花开不是钱。\n鸾鹤久从笼槛闭，春风却放纸爲鸢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}